<div>
    <h2>Welcome <%= startupName %> </h2>
    <p>Please provide some details about your startup.</p>
</div>
<br>
<div>
    <p>What sector is <%= startupName %> in? </p>
    <input id="sector" type="text" placeholder="Sector">
</div>
<br>
<div>
    <p>What investment phase are you is <%= startupName %> currently in?</p>
    <select name="phase" id="phase">
        <option value="pre-seed">Pre-Seed</option>
        <option value="seed">Seed</option>
        <option value="startup">Startup</option>
        <option value="series-a">Series A</option>
        <option value="series-b">Series B</option>
        <option value="series-c">Series C</option>
        <option value="series-d">Series D</option>
        <option value="ipo">IPO</option>
        <option value="emerging-growth">Emerging Growth</option>
        <option value="conquering">Conquering</option>
        <option value="capturing">Capturing</option>
    </select>
</div>
<br>
<div>
    <p>To what percentage have the milestones for this phase been completed?</p>
    <input type="number" id="progress"> <span>%</span>
</div>
<br>
<div>
    <p>Please specify when the investment phase will be completed according to the business plan.</p>
    <input type="date" id="due-date-phase">
</div>
<br>
<div>
    <p>Has <%= startupName %> brought a product to market yet?</p>
    <select name="product-to-market" id="product-to-market">
        <option value="yes">Yes</option>
        <option value="no">No</option>
    </select>
    <br>
    <br>
    <div id="est-time-to-market" class="hidden">
        <p>If no, what is your estimated time to market?</p>
        <input id="time-to-market" type="number"><span> Months</span>
    </div>
</div>
<br>
<div>
    <p>Please upload the current capitalization table in an Excel format.</p>

   <form id="cap-table-form" action="/onboarding/cap-table" enctype="multipart/form-data" method="post">
        <input type="file" name="cap-table" />
    </form>
    <button onclick="submitCapTable()">Submit Cap Table</button>
</div>
<br>
    <div id="cap-table-div" class="hidden">
        <div>
            <h3>Cap-Table</h3>
            <table id="cap-table"></table>
        </div>
        <br>
        <div>
            <button onclick="submitStartupData()">Submit Startup Information</button>
        </div>
    </div>
<br>
